# Header self-sufficiency / compile fixes for WebCore.
# Merged from 11 patches: webkit-quirks-no-video,
# webkit-webcore-user-message-handlers-platform,
# webkit-webcore-colorconversion-export-macros,
# webkit-webcore-webkitnamespace-platform, webkit-webcore-avif-platform,
# webkit-webcore-avif-reader-platform, webkit-webcore-context-export-macros,
# webkit-webcore-bitmaptexturepool-owners, webkit-webcore-texmap-owner-headers,
# webkit-renderbox-isnan, webkit-shapeoutside-isnan.
#
# Same class as the WTF/PAL and JSC portability patches (Platform.h /
# PlatformExportMacros.h / <cmath> ownership), plus two shape fixes that belong
# with them: `isnan` -> `std::isnan` with an explicit <cmath>, and an
# ENABLE(VIDEO) guard around the HTMLVideoElement include in Quirks.cpp for
# video-less configurations. Behaviour-neutral.
#
# ---
